[69.031548, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G  Also a list for the home page that shows only upcom\u001b[57Gng events, plus a detail page. EXT:news has \u001b[102Go\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bdate\u001b[10Gfields\u001b[21Gev\u001b[24Gnts, so this needs a decision (see b\u001b[61Glow)\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mAlready there:\u001b[22m CSS; the content is in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdesign/docs/news-and-events.docx\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mSection:\u001b[22m \u001b[1mNewsletter sign-up\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mWha\u001b[7G you n\u001b[14Ged:\u001b[22m A form definition\u001b[36Gin\u001b[39GEXT:form\u001b[48G(email,\u001b[56Gtopics,\u001b[64Gconsent)\u001b[73Gand\u001b[77Gsomething\u001b[87Gthat\u001b[92Gactually\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  handles the subsc\u001b[23Giption. The design asks for double opt-in, which EXT:for\u001b[80G doesn'\u001b[88G do\u001b[92Gby itself.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BYou'd also need \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdesign/js/forms.js\u001b[39m for the validation in the\u001b[66Gbrowser\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mAlready there:\u001b[22m EXT:form is installed; CSS\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BAll\u001b[7Gof\u001b[10Gthese\u001b[16Gare\u001b[20Gcontent\u001b[28Gelements\u001b[37Gstacked\u001b[45Gin\u001b[48Gthe\u001b[52Gexisting\u001b[61G\"main\"\u001b[68Gcolumn,\u001b[76Gso\u001b[79Gthe\u001b[83GHome\u001b[88Gbackend\u001b[96Glayout\u001b[103Gand\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Btemplate don't need \u001b[24Go change.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mTwo decisions I need from you:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B1.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mHow to store events:\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m  \u001b[6G- Build them on top of\u001b[29Gnews,\u001b[35Gwith\u001b[40Gan\u001b[43G\"is\u001b[47Gevent\"\u001b[54Gflag\u001b[59Gand\u001b[63Gdate\u001b[68Gfields.\u001b[76GThis\u001b[81Greuses\u001b[88Gthe\