[175.938897, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIf\u001b[6Gyou\u001b[10Ganswer\u001b[17Gthe\u001b[21Gtwo\u001b[25Gquestions,\u001b[36GI'll\u001b[41Gbuild\u001b[47Git\u001b[50Gin\u001b[53Gthis\u001b[58Gorder:\u001b[65Gslider\u001b[72Gand\u001b[76Gtiles\u001b[82Gfirst\u001b[88G(no\u001b[92Gopen\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bdecisions), then events, then the newsletter.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBrewed for 31s · done 11:31 AM\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mhat sounds like a lot. What should I start with, and why?\u001b[39m                                               \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mStart\u001b[9Gwith\u001b[14Gthe\u001b[18G\u001b[1mservice tiles\u001b[22m:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt's the smallest piece.\u001b[30G\u001b[22mIt's\u001b[35Ga\u001b[37Glist\u001b[42Gof\u001b[45Glinks,\u001b[52Geach\u001b[57Gwith\u001b[62Gan\u001b[65Gicon\u001b[70Gand\u001b[74Ga\u001b[76Glabel.\u001b[83GThere's\u001b[91Gno\u001b[94GJavaScript,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gno new data model and nothing\u001b[35Gto decide\u001b[45Gf\u001b[47Grst.\u001b[52G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mIt sets up the pattern for the slider.\u001b[22m Both are\u001b[53Gcustom\u001b[60Gcontent\u001b[68Gelements\u001b[77Gthat\u001b[82Ghold\u001b[87Ga\u001b[89Glist\u001b[94Gof\u001b[97Gitems.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GOnce the tiles work, the slider is the\u001b[44Gsame\u001b[49Gshape with\u001b[60Gan image, text and \u001b[80G button per item, plu\u001b[102G\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mslider.js\u001b[39m. Building the ti\u001b[32Ges fir\u001b[39Gt m\u001b[43Gans the slider is mostly a\u001b[70Gcopy\u001b[75Gof a pat\u001b[84Ger\u001b[88Gthat already works.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mThe links mostly hav